{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/853973-musing-with-one-hundred-hands-an-evening-with-a-centimani","id":853973,"title":"Musing with One Hundred Hands: An evening with a Centimani","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-27T04:47:07-07:00","id":853973,"title":"Musing with One Hundred Hands: An evening with a Centimani","content":"Good evening, Cazodore...Are you comfortable? Do the ropes hurt and chafe your flesh? I can tell by your thrashing they either hurt quite a bit, or you're quite angry with me. Would you like a sedative? Unfortunately I need you lucid for what we're going to discuss or I would give you some of my Ketamine...Don't ask where I got it, you wouldn't like the answer I'm afraid. <br /> <br /> You are probably wondering, little Promethean, why you are tied to a chair in the basement of a church. Why you are not currently being feasted on by my...companions, I know you can see them, or if not that, at least hear them as they scuttle above us. Rest assured, they're not going to consume your flesh without my leave, they fear me, they know I am stronger, and they will not risk annihilation at my hand for a brief meal. They may not be particularly intelligent, but their instincts direct them away from oblivion. <br /> <br /> You are quite safe here, safer then you would be among the mewling herds of humanity, the teeming masses of hate and anger and fury. So do relax, if I wanted you dead I would of fed you into a wood chipper the moment you ignored the rather clear signs on the door of the church. Pandoran, Centimanus, Danger, and one or two that those dead men have put up there as well. I don't particularly mind THEM snooping around nearly as much as I do my cousins. <br /> <br /> They know not what they do, you know full well what you've done by coming here with the intent to slay me, perhaps to consume some 'wasted' vitriol out of my form...Ooooh, you stopped thrashing around, didn't think I saw that hunger in your eyes? Being judged by a cannibal, that would be a new experience, I can feel my anathor churning already...Fortunately for you, I've long since come past the tendency to judge my fellow Created, we must all find our way to the dawn, or dusk in my case.<br /> <br /> Let me begin with a story, and do pay attention, not that you can do much else, those 'ropes' are tentacles of a particularly unusual breed of Pandoran, rather certain its made of the Sinew of failed Osirans, strong stuff. I was born in Ohio, the result of a little too much fallout blowing off of the Trinity test site and making its way east, irradiating a few children with auto immune disorders a little more then their bodies could handle. Fortunately I came out the other side fully grown, we are more then the sum of our parts, after all. You seem confused, yes the Zeky exist, yes you are listening to one speak. <br /> <br /> Do you know what I saw my first few months of existence? Riots, hatred, bigotry, the Red Menace alive and striking at the shores of the Land of the Free, the Cubans wanting only to be free and being locked away on their little island for being Red rather then Dead, Black men dying for having the audacity to stand up and demand to be treated like the men they are. On and on and on, the back end of the 20th century was not a fun time for something like myself. <br /> <br /> But I endured, their hatred made me strong, their paranoia made me all the stealthier, and their words of violence and ardor filled me with passion...I understood then, six millennium of civilization, and THAT was the best you can do? A society filled with hate, fear, xenophobia, paranoia, they curled up around their TVs to hear about the Communists in Vietnam and Korea and Germany, dreadfully paralyzed in fear of the other. <br /> <br /> It hasn't changed, you know, the tides turned of course, communism fell, but now its the Muslims, the Immigrants, the poor, the poor Blacks never managed to get off the human shit list entirely, Mexicans who pick their food and keep them fed being beaten senseless outside rallies for political entities who's only qualifications are a loud mouth and a bad hairpiece. And you say to me &quot;You must struggle to become one of these mewling apes curled around the campfires of their TV's, huddled against the dark in fear of all that are the wrong color and speak the wrong language&quot;?<br /> <br /> I beg to differ, Cazodore. <br /> <br /> I won't become one of those pathetic, mewling wretches, so full of fear, so full of hate, so full of misery. The pain I feel from my carcinoma and tumors and cataracts are nothing compared to the pain these beings have in their souls. I am a monster, yes, but I am at peace with what I am, my form is bloated with tumors and mutations, and yet I know not fear, I know not hate, I know not despair. For I march towards Dusk, and the twilight of Flux...Oh don't give me that look, every night ends, every winter gives way to spring, entropy is king, yes, but from entropy comes new life. <br /> <br /> The humans fear death, the destroyer of worlds as Mr. Oppenheimer would say, but he left out the bit about new life coming from death. Understand oblivion, Cazodore, and you will understand the way to rise, to truly CHANGE, and become something other...Mmmmm, perhaps I do understand fear a little, now that I ponder on it, I do fear what I will become...But it is a GOOD fear, and it sets my soul AFIRE! <br /> <br /> ...Oh dear, I know that look, let me just tuck those back away for a moment, terribly sorry about that, got a little caught up in the moment...If you like, I can show you how that transmutation works before you leave, excellent for crawling up...No? Very well, if you're quite sure...At any rate, while I COULD rip your anathor out and consume the contents, feed your flesh to my Pandorans...and I'll be honest, I had intended that at the start of this evening...I feel that would be something of a waste, its not every night I get to tell this story to beings capable of actually hearing it. You can imagine what an unappreciative audience Carcinomas are, you'd think with their lack of eyes they'd listen a bit better, but what can one do? <br /> <br /> In twenty four hours, the sinew will release...I'll be long gone, of course, I already have a ticket to...well, lets keep some secrets between us, shall we? Of course, you won't be able to forget what you heard here, I can see it in your eyes, its already starting to sink in, the doubt, the pain, the Torment...I'll be waiting for you in the dark when you realize the truth of my statements, little Promethean...Until then, my friend, I shall see you soon...<br /> <br /> <br /> Authors Note: I got kinda tired of seeing people view Centimani as ravening monsters like the Bale Hounds. There's SO much more to the things, and if they're played right, they can really open up some unpleasant revelations about the human condition...But these issues need to be tackled head on if humanity is ever going to move past them, ignoring it just lets them fester, and every so often you've got to lance the pus out of the wound if you want the thing to heal properly. Might hurt, might not be fun, but its better then letting it rot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1645-autochthon","name":"Autochthon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T05:48:24-07:00","id":854428,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;Mexicans who pick their food... beaten senseless for political entities who's only qualifications are a loud mouth and a bad hairpiece&quot; </div> </div> </div>Subtle, very subtle. No wall references?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 03-28-2016, 08:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T06:08:19-07:00","id":854438,"title":"","content":"Excellent little piece. I've never really played Centimani as ravening monsters, always as tragic figures who gave up hope.<br /> <br /> -A Promethean who wandered the american north for 2 centuries, always trying to help (with his powers) and never receiving thanks, finally decided to turn into the monster everyone sees him as.<br /> -The eldest of a Throng sees a large group of hunters honing on them and decides to protect his friends and family by harnessing the power of Flux, losing himself in it<br /> -An Ulgan went mad from the spirits and turned into an apocalypse prophet, claiming that the Spirit world will soon pierce the material world. Abusing the powers of entropy was his way of keeping the merging as far away as possible<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}